## 3. Update Record

### 3.1 Endpoint

```
PUT {BASE_URL}/api/v1/Portals/approval/PWD
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
```

### 3.2 Request Body (JSON)

`spId`, `pwdNumber`, and `status` are **required**.

| Field                   | Type   | Required | Description                            | ពិពណ៌នា                    |
|-------------------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------|---------------------------|
| `spId`            | string | **Yes**  | Target status (see Section 3.4)        | ស្ថានភាព                   |
| `pwdNumber`           | string | **Yes**       | Disability Code                   | លេខបណ្ណសមធម៏                  |
| `status`           | string | **Yes**       | Request Status                   | ស្ថានភាពការអនុម័ត                  |

### Example
```json
{
    "spId": "3406182715",
    "pwdNumber": "020203066399780",
    "status": "approved"
}

```




### 3.4 Allowed Status Values

| Value               | Code   | Meaning (EN)                 | ពិពណ៌នា (KH)                         |
|---------------------|--------|------------------------------|--------------------------------------|
| `PWD_PENDING`       | PWD_P  | Pending at provincial level  | សំណើរងចាំពីមន្ទីរ                     |
| `PWD_APPROVED`      | PWD_A  | Approved by ministry         | សំណើដែលបានអនុម័តពីក្រសួង              |
| `PWD_MODIFIED`      | PWD_M  | Requires modification        | សំណើដែលត្រូវកែតម្រូវ                   |
| `PWD_REINTERVIEWED` | PWD_R  | Requires re-interview        | សំណើដែលត្រូវសម្ភាសន៍ឡើងវិញ            |

> Pass the **enum name** (e.g. `PWD_APPROVED`) as the `new_status` value.

### 3.5 Success Response — `200 OK`

```json
{
    "spId": "3406182715",
    "pwdNumber": "020203066399780",
    "status": "approved"
}

```

