## 4. Error Reference

| HTTP Code | Meaning              | Cause & Resolution                                                            |
|-----------|----------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `401`     | Unauthorized         | Token missing, expired, or invalid. Obtain a new token (Section 2).           |
| `403`     | Forbidden            | Account not authorized. Contact SPR team.                                     |
| `404`     | Not Found            | No record matches the given `disability_code`. Verify the code.               |
| `422`     | Unprocessable Entity | Invalid field value or missing `new_status`. Check request body.              |
| `500`     | Internal Server Error| Server-side issue. Retry after a short delay. Contact SPR if persistent.      |

**Error response format:**

```json
{
  "detail": "Human-readable error message"
}
```

