## 6. Best Practices

| Practice                | Detail                                                                 |
|-------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Cache tokens**        | Reuse the access token until it expires (~5 min). Don't request a new token per call. |
| **Use refresh tokens**  | Refresh instead of re-authenticating with username/password each time. |
| **Retry on 401**        | Get a fresh token and retry once.                                      |
| **Send only changed fields** | Omit fields you don't want to change — only `new_status` is required. |
| **Idempotent calls**    | Setting the same values twice is safe — no side effects.               |
| **Rate limiting**       | Keep requests under 60/minute. Batch updates where possible.           |

